<title>USA: Apple Q2 shr loss $5.64 after charges.</title>
<headline>Apple Q2 shr loss $5.64 after charges.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>APPLE COMPUTER, INC.</p>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF OPERATIONS (Unaudited)</p>
<p>		  (Dollars in millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				 THREE MONTHS ENDED  SIX MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>				   Mar 28,  Mar 29,  Mar 28,  Mar 29,</p>
<p>				     1997	1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net sales		     $ 1,601  $ 2,185  $ 3,730  $ 5,333</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>    Cost of sales		1,298    2,606    3,030    5,279</p>
<p>    Research and development   141	150	290	303</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>     administrative		348	404	720	845</p>
<p>In-process research</p>
<p>     and development	     375	 --	375	 --</p>
<p> Restructuring costs	     155	207	155	207</p>
<p>				     2,317    3,367    4,570    6,634</p>
<p> Operating loss		  (716)  (1,182)    (840)  (1,301)</p>
