<p>calculations of loss per share</p>
<p>    (in thousands)	   125,609  123,659  125,071  123,326</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 includes a $375 million charge to write-off research and devlopment activity related to its acquisition of NeXT Software Inc.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 includes a $155 million charge to boost reserves associated with its current restructuring plan.</p>
<p>Excluding the charges, the operating loss for Q2 ended March 28, 1997 was $186 million, or $1.48 a share.</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate was a loss of $1.22.</p>
